godot/pull/111624#issuecomment-3405486525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111624","id":3405486525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7K-5m9","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-15T09:35:55Z","updated_at":"2025-10-15T09:36:29Z","body":"I think this PR should be reverted. The trade-off of breaking the UI layout is not worth it.\r\n\r\nI agree though that a more prevalent \"show in file manager\" feature would be useful. But I'd rather expect it to be in the right click menu of project items. I've opened a proposal for this: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13389","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3405486525/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":11,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]